---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../data/site-config.json';

const lastUpdated = 'February 20, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How we use affiliate links on Best US National Parks. Full transparency about how we earn commissions."
>
  <div class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Affiliate Disclosure
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-lg">
            Transparency matters to us. This page explains how {siteConfig.name} earns money
            through affiliate links, what that means for you, and how it does not affect our
            recommendations.
          </p>

          <h2>What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
          <p>
            Some links on our website are "affiliate links." When you click one and make a
            purchase, we earn a small commission. <strong>This costs you nothing extra.</strong>
            The price you pay is exactly the same whether you use our link or go directly to
            the retailer.
          </p>

          <h2>How We Use Them</h2>
          <p>
            We are a participant in the <strong>Amazon Associates Program</strong>, an affiliate
            advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees
            by linking to Amazon.com. You will find affiliate links primarily on our
            <a href="/gear" class="link-primary">gear recommendations page</a>, where we
            suggest outdoor equipment, hiking boots, backpacks, cameras, and other national
            park essentials.
          </p>
          <p>
            Revenue from these links helps us keep {siteConfig.name} free, maintain accurate
            park information, and create new guides and resources without relying on intrusive
            advertising.
          </p>

          <h2>Editorial Independence</h2>
          <p>
            Our gear recommendations are based on quality, value, and real-world usefulness
            for park visitors. We recommend products because we believe they will genuinely
            help you have a better experience in the parks.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>We only recommend gear we believe provides real value</li>
            <li>Commission rates never influence what we recommend</li>
            <li>We include non-affiliate alternatives when they are the better choice</li>
            <li>Many products we recommend have no affiliate program at all</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>What We Don't Do</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>We don't accept payment in exchange for product reviews or recommendations</li>
            <li>We don't let affiliate commissions influence our park guides or travel advice</li>
            <li>We don't prioritize products with higher commissions over better products</li>
            <li>We don't hide the fact that we use affiliate links</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>FTC Compliance</h2>
          <p>
            Per the Federal Trade Commission's guidelines on endorsements and advertising, we
            disclose that:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>We may receive compensation when you purchase through our links</li>
            <li>All opinions and recommendations are our own</li>
            <li>We only endorse products we believe are genuinely helpful to our readers</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Questions?</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or how we choose what
            to recommend, reach out anytime:
          </p>
          <p>
            Email: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`} class="link-primary">{siteConfig.contact.email}</a>
          </p>

          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-xl p-6 mt-8">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-0">
              <strong>Thank you</strong> for supporting {siteConfig.name}. When you use our
              affiliate links, you help us keep this site running and free for everyone. We
              appreciate your trust and will always put your interests first.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    @apply text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4;
  }
  .prose p {
    @apply text-gray-700 mb-4;
  }
  .prose ul {
    @apply list-disc list-inside mb-6 space-y-1;
  }
  .prose li {
    @apply text-gray-700;
  }
</style>
